      "value": "I can't +1 enough, it would do so much to help revive public worlds!!! The information isn't just 1 click away because we're checking entire lists of worlds.\n\nFor the design issue, an easy first step might be to change this on the website's Favorite Worlds page. Add a new field for Public Users In-World.\n\nOtherwise, I don't care about private player count and even if it is useful as  proxy for popularity, I'd choose public player count any day as the more useful stat.",
